{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "bdee8dddb586bc21c29e1adf516bd5fc4aa152fc1a0ece54eaec3f303d5612b0", "ja": "Recover ～慣れないことでも～", "zh": "Recover ～即使还不习惯～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "786fcc10e8a0d97d13467656d60c81fcf8af658e22d38ce5aea0ce58064ebbac", "ja": "CM撮影当日。お洒落なカフェの店員を任さ\nれた雪歩は緊張気味。プロデューサーはみん\nなでの練習を提案する。恵美のカスタマイズ\nに慌てたりしつつ、千鶴のフォローもあって\n結果は成功、雪歩は自信を持つ事ができた。", "zh": "广告拍摄当天。负责饰演时髦咖啡馆店员\n的雪步有些紧张。制作人提议大家一起\n进行练习。虽然面对惠美的定制要求有些手忙\n脚乱，但在千鹤的协助下最终顺利成功，\n雪步也重拾了自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aecba1c31d196be1d5971de8ea168459dee005f8e649b628ba3a5fa569f77862", "ja": "（今日は、例のCMの撮影日。\nまずは律子と恵美の撮影が終わった……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄那个CM的日子。\n律子和惠美的拍摄首先结束了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "6bda046c6fc1f7d3d1f6766a2ca9f9695a5cf2d97770f6d0020e481a16f335c0", "ja": "{$P$}、アタシの華麗な\nチャリさばき、見た？　バイクより速かったでしょ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，我那华丽的自行车骑术，看到了吗？比摩托还快吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "344fdec393733b9593f9a0e65a9e5db9904ebcab30b15616b894fa69f5891674", "ja": "私も、楽しませてもらいました。色合わせや\n部分的な流行の取り入れ方とか、参考になります。", "zh": "我也玩得很开心。配色，还有局部融入流行元素的方式，都很值得参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "794c8ce4e9db3316025b1ad4edb8ab5d1ddbe966a1be1d307a93e1ed25916ee1", "ja": "服飾系も、けっこう面白いですね。\n資格ってあるのかしら……。", "zh": "服装设计这方面，还挺有意思的呢。\n不知道有没有相关资格证……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8bfa1203d118b2fda52ec51a6f0aaa0e7a9f725d08a91aafc0070e9fab963471", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさま！\nいい経験ができたみたいで良かったよ。", "zh": "你们两个，辛苦了！\n看来你们都积累了很棒的经验，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "db2157dc22ccc01b6a522fbd37065463503ef5d29c29f572a6cc681326964174", "ja": "次は、千鶴さんと雪歩だけど……\n大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "接下来是千鹤和雪步……\n没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "bef70b617ef9487acf7581089bcfd427ea24a7c5d72cc26f7472d90dac6eece1", "ja": "もちろんですわ。台本もしっかり読み込んできましたし\n……わたくしが、華麗なレジ打ちをお見せしますわ！", "zh": "那是自然。台词我也已经仔细研读过了\n……就由我来为您展现华丽的收银英姿吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "1c0b1dedf7ba928a28d27885a32035d539558a8e41db39241744a6ae809bec37", "ja": "おー、めっちゃハードル上げるじゃん千鶴！\n雪歩も、ガツンといっちゃえ！", "zh": "哦——把门槛抬得够高嘛，千鹤！雪步也要拿出真本事来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ea5bdd674b77a407f64d768068f101e18b9a0ff45c3254dd653cb5a56ce93883", "ja": "は、はいっ！　あの、が、がんばりますぅ！\n……だ、大丈夫。ちゃんと、練習通りにやれば……。", "zh": "是、是的！那个，我、我会努力的！\n……没、没关系。只要按照练习时那样做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0dd909d6ad82dd2d8faf0fccd5ccacd4c2436039f3138783a0cac8114400b2a0", "ja": "（千鶴さんは大丈夫そうだけど……\n雪歩は、だいぶ緊張しているみたいだな）", "zh": "（千鹤看起来没问题，不过……雪步好像紧张得相当厉害啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4104c0f510aacc84f5f3ecffab55a56c88dfae76cb8947f3a589a977e474e85c", "ja": "雪歩。まだリハーサル開始まで少し時間があるし、\nここにいるメンバーを相手に、練習してみたらどうだ？", "zh": "雪步，离彩排开始还有一点时间，\n要不要对着在场的成员练习一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c2ade5999e38aca2e9c114eb71b35d6af40fb386429ed358b8f18f2fda56d0a6", "ja": "練習……？", "zh": "练习……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "10791f82af0fd335fad73164ab1c177c26fa95b73dd18fb76667b14b494534da", "ja": "いいですわね！　スタッフさんに、\nドリンクを作るところからできるか、聞いてみますわ。", "zh": "好主意！我去问问工作人员，能不能从调制饮料开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "0041dc407740ca1c4a3ccef81e11b5bf911c6881fe52a83d4a6aa2c4594912dd", "ja": "それじゃアタシ、お客さん役やったげるよ！\n{$P$}もね♪", "zh": "那我来演客人吧！\n{$P$}也一起来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "d8fed850910515e47acea888e20d71173ac14f40d943b81c44b650ea8c6f004b", "ja": "女子高生にサラリーマン……うん。コーヒーショップの\nお客さんとしては、多い層じゃないかしら。", "zh": "女高中生和上班族……嗯。作为咖啡厅的\n客人，这些群体的占比还挺高的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "5f8af7d8daad7e03d841d91f8369da9a7981a6cb03339a26e19464e51f0f13df", "ja": "それに、恵美と{$P$}が相手なら、\n緊張しないかもしれないわよ、雪歩。", "zh": "而且，如果对手是惠美和{$P$}，说不定就不会紧张了呢，雪步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "91298cf817efeef6a77017fd08cac30b7c5dc3f4340ebecb578477674dc13895", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……。\nいつまでも、緊張してるわけにはいかないし……。", "zh": "是、是这样没错……。\n也不能一直这么紧张下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "837357fffd003a08c99435191fac0e1a1638d02a03fe3c61b43dbb1c8dc90741", "ja": "私……がんばってみます！　恵美ちゃん、\n{$P$}も、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我……会努力的！恵美，\n还有{$P$}，请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "b2a417220503f15301b3dce6555048cc5bd95cfe34944dbd4b55da3b48d35588", "ja": "やっほ、店員さん♪\nホットのカフェラテ、ひとつお願い♪", "zh": "嗨喽，店员小姐♪\n来一杯热拿铁♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "414ddfac7deb251f803216a5b19c87fcfa2c199b0c25059d29283507007b5c00", "ja": "あ、はい！　ホットのカフェラテですね。\nえっと、サイズは、どうされますか？", "zh": "啊，好的！热拿铁一杯。\n那个，请问您要什么尺寸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f0ee50ea0337f3ea65a8c8d9c2526db7be094399775619256622bdbe5becad09", "ja": "（少しぎこちなさも残るけど……雪歩、\n問題なさそうだな。これなら本番も……）", "zh": "（虽说还残留着些许生涩……雪步，看来没问题。这样的话正式拍摄也……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "1c1bea6b0e05d4fc6256a60e101ff380beae9e551e403011c958e28030049778", "ja": "えっと、サイズはレギュラーで！　あとホイップと、\nキャラメルソースとチョコレートソースも追加ね！", "zh": "那个，尺寸要中杯！另外还要加奶油、焦糖酱和巧克力酱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "fc354c979d5c512096d8a5ac6658e5c0677b4a4474a4c1d847ee049f83012ddb", "ja": "あっ、あとミルクを変更で、低脂肪牛乳にして～。\nあ、ホイップとシロップは多めね♪　あと～……。", "zh": "啊，对了，牛奶换成低脂牛奶～  \n还有，奶油和糖浆都多加一点♪　然后～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8804e33ae147e3ce87bd678e501d17a018b53771d1015ad14b6601146616b4f7", "ja": "は、はいぃっ！　……ホイップに、低脂肪牛乳で……\nチョコレートシロップが……！？", "zh": "好、好的！……鲜奶油、低脂牛奶……巧克力糖浆……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "cd4ee76f36a4fc455bf4e61280113b23888ee92c44ec97beaa7784571dc06daf", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと恵美！　初心者の雪歩に、\nいきなりカスタマイズの注文なんて、難しすぎない？", "zh": "等、等等！惠美！对初学者雪步来说，一上来就点这么复杂的定制，不觉得太难了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "d1a4b9673863a6575965ac11c02bec66de4e719a115f821d670f8be358aadcd2", "ja": "いやいや、これも必要な練習でしょ！\n厳しい愛のムチってやつ？", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，这也是必要的练习嘛！\n所谓的爱之深责之切？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "2897546dfdcf7527e0d8e7c07e473b537eddd43882b23900608c69351e6fa4cd", "ja": "んじゃ、アタシは以上で！\n店員さん、お会計いくらですか？", "zh": "那我就先到这里！\n店员，多少钱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1cb5d34559028f81fdfce66624af2e31a3097938c745d4beefc5fd8bb2d8ae18", "ja": "は、はいぃっ！？", "zh": "怎、怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1030_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e2d4ba5cf331b7fd975bb26e4516632e7f115df1c56769f9f498efe6ce2008cd", "ja": "え、えっと、カフェラテのレギュラーが450円で、\nそれにトッピングが入るから……あわわ……。", "zh": "呃、那个，拿铁的中杯是450日元，再加上配料的话……啊哇哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "51f2d8a9150824ddce0c76a0e753c71d555f257057c17df699dfc744a6b204e8", "ja": "雪歩ちゃん、落ち着いてくださいまし。\nこういう時は、慌てずに対応するのが大切ですわ。", "zh": "雪步，请冷静一些。像这种时候，重要的是不要慌张，从容应对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1032_038chz", "source_sha256": "b9b9065300a5f94d714816b83b521fd25631b4c93f9d67a53adb446ddb6511fe", "ja": "たしか低脂肪牛乳は、無料で変更できたはず……\nほら、ここですわ。レジの画面をタッチすると……。", "zh": "我记得低脂牛奶应该可以免费更换……\n您看，就是这里。触碰收银机的屏幕后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "7a5a961ab6d327683625d9af0aa3ba37ad4df7f16a07c4e1169649c7b8ad072e", "ja": "それから、シロップの量も無料で変更できますわね。\nホイップとソースはそれぞれ＋50円ですので……。", "zh": "另外，糖浆的分量也可以免费调整呢。鲜奶油和酱汁分别要加50日元，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1034_004yuk", "source_sha256": "68c7804444fc821125455a21eb68777c42ae07df945422db3054d14c36389464", "ja": "わっ……千鶴さん、すごい……！　まるで、\nどこに何のボタンがあるかわかってるみたい……。", "zh": "哇……千鹤，好厉害……！简直就像知道每个按钮在哪里、分别是什么一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1035_038chz", "source_sha256": "6116f44db8eafcb5018f4977143de342d0342a8bddb80217a7251edc41d85142", "ja": "最後に、小計ボタンを押せば……\nお会計は、600円ですわ。", "zh": "最后，按下小计按钮……\n合计金额是600日元呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1036_020meg", "source_sha256": "34e7c8ba4ccff61804bbb184288d6a52806def74fd27255ebfe166691c212ab8", "ja": "どれどれ……。おおー、本当だっ！　\nえっ、千鶴スゴイじゃん！", "zh": "让我看看……哦——真的耶！\n诶，千鹤，你好厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "96c9fffd10ffb7bdd85c2ef56bc41417e9212ad10e6510cfbdb0799525167365", "ja": "本当、ビックリしちゃった。\n千鶴さん、レジを扱ったことがあるんですか？", "zh": "真的吓了一跳。\n千鹤，你以前操作过收银机吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1038_038chz", "source_sha256": "544b1c6d4b905b0a558b09abfd56c2052dbe139d6fed04d86d20468e5d4e88ca", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、それは……その……！", "zh": "诶！？那、那个……这个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "6d73e57ed531b50605999196c1749955b0e60fa4535600a1c4275a78f464f84e", "ja": "スーパーの店員役をこなすために、自主レッスンを\n積んできてくれたんですよね？　流石です！", "zh": "为了演好超市店员这个角色，你一直在自主练习，对吧？不愧是你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1040_038chz", "source_sha256": "b566a80b7f2f0be06032a43134252c94fd1324fbb05b40cc91c9e4b663a6f401", "ja": "え、ええ……バレてしまっては、仕方ありませんわね！\n実は今日のために、練習してきたんですの！", "zh": "呃、嗯……既然被发现了，也没办法了呢！\n其实，为了今天，我特意练习过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "c4da19378330d6da989f89ac6ad5f95a65dd61b41bed0e1a486c1bf5704a21b4", "ja": "は～、そうなんだ。\n千鶴ってホント努力家だよね～。", "zh": "哈～，原来是这样啊。\n千鹤真的是个很努力的人呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1042_009rit", "source_sha256": "3e51afc70b8a9db71aa3feb502531d6e48955202a45e5d85221408d7e3e7c8a6", "ja": "そうね……まさかレジ打ちの練習までなんて。\nプロ根性ですね、千鶴さん！", "zh": "是啊……没想到连收银都要练习。\n真是有专业精神呢，千鹤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1043_038chz", "source_sha256": "ee2cb0fabc2be437db7746b6a1286a169b1fd7dff0bd7fffb24ac506a6a9a145", "ja": "そ、そんな大したことではありませんわ！？\nそれより、ドリンクが完成したみたいですわ！", "zh": "没、没什么大不了的！？  \n比起这个，饮料好像已经做好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1044_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9cd95e95b07c0b748a47738eefa77b6236a43652f7619c1fb5f4c842da188c8e", "ja": "はい！　それじゃ、えっと……\nお客さま、お待たせいたしましたっ！", "zh": "好的！那么，那个……\n客人，让您久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1045_020meg", "source_sha256": "995ec3948fc47ed5a126bc2c48e63dd4bc28c34e941964bb28e0704c5a68dc50", "ja": "ありがと！　……わ、すっごくおいしそう！\nそれじゃさっそく、いただきま～す♪", "zh": "谢谢！……哇，看起来好好吃！\n那我可就不客气啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "70e87731425d338cbec69b5c340bbfe7fdc5a93919bbbaf1a2a5786f1b46a4e6", "ja": "雪歩、今商品を渡す時、すごくいい笑顔だったな。\nその調子でいけば、本番もきっと大丈夫だと思うよ。", "zh": "雪步，你刚才递出商品时，笑容特别棒。照这样下去，正式演出时肯定也没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1047_004yuk", "source_sha256": "765be89d585cd9ef668be11ae00761ad1b66c209b7c6dcaffc4435554a8258bd", "ja": "ほ、本当ですかぁ？　よかった……。\n落ち着いてやれば、大丈夫な気がしてきました……。", "zh": "真、真的吗？太好了……\n只要冷静下来，我感觉就没问题了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1048_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6503efd50be4f22e2c1234d4a09718990034606a8e0a527fc6d8cefa1fb5d399", "ja": "恵美ちゃん、律子さん、{$P$}……\n千鶴さんも、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "惠美、律子、{$P$}……\n千鹤，也谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_03_1049_038chz", "source_sha256": "d49034092cff85710c7eb254992c4b65de8a7b301352aade812297818bd62177", "ja": "わたくしは、ほんの少し助言をしただけですわ。\n雪歩ちゃん、本番もこの調子でがんばりますわよ！", "zh": "我只是稍微提了点建议而已。\n雪步，本场也要保持这个状态加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
